 e.  g.,  Motorola  Satellite  Communications,  Inc.  (Order  and  Authorization),  DA  96-  1789,  11  FCC  Rcd  13952  (Int’l  Bur.  1996),  and  L/  Q  Licensee,  Inc.  (Order  and  Authorization),  DA  96-  1924,  11  FCC  Rcd  16410  (Int’l  Bur.  1996). 


